d: Everything You Need to Know about the Latest Supply Chain Attack. Retrieved July 1, 2026.", "source_name": "Wiz Trivy Compromise MAR 2026", "url": "https://www.wiz.io/blog/trivy-compromised-teampcp-supply-chain-attack"}, {"description": "McCarthy, R., Haughom, J., Read, B. (2026, March 23). KICS GitHub Action Compromised: TeamPCP Strikes Again in Supply Chain Attack. Retrieved July 1, 2026.", "source_name": "Wiz TeamPCP KICS MAR 2026", "url": "https://www.wiz.io/blog/teampcp-attack-kics-github-action"}, {"description": "Sysdig Threat Research Team. (2026, March 23). TeamPCP expands: Supply chain compromise spreads from Trivy to Checkmarx GitHub Actions. Retrieved July 1, 2026.", "source_name": "Sysdig TeamPCP MAR 2026", "url": "https://www.sysdig.com/blog/teampcp-expands-supply-chain-compromise-spreads-from-trivy-to-checkmarx-github-actions"}, {"description": "Unit 42. (2026, March 31). Weaponizing the Protectors: TeamPCP’s Multi-Stage Supply Chain Attack on Security Infrastructure. Retrieved July 1, 2026.", "source_name": "Palo Alto TeamPCP MAR 2026", "url": "https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/teampcp-supply-chain-attacks/"}], "id": "relationship--a817761e-2772-4cc0-887b-cc539d6c616e", "modified": "2026-07-29T21:50:43.851Z", "object_marking_refs": ["marking-definition--fa42a846-8d90-4e51-bc29-71d5b4802168"], "relationship_type": "uses", "revoked": false, "source_ref": "malware--fe5b2f0f-8fdc-459d-85b7-dd45c0217a0c", "spec_version": "2.1", "target_ref": "attack-pattern--cfb525cc-5494-401d-a82b-2539ca46a561", "type": "relationship", "x_mitre_attack_spec_version": "3.3.0", "x_mitre_deprecated": false, "x_mitre_modified_by_ref": "identity--c78cb6e5-0c4b-4611-8297-d1b8b55e40b5"}', 'kb-doc-09-mitre-attack-p0-24427', 0, 331, '09-mitre-attack', 'retrieved', 'AC40FC3D61EA9B3A37814574F93926E562EA2A81AF32802AE5004A1B93D43C94', 'v1', '{"source_id": "09-mitre-attack", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "STRUCTURED_DATA"}')
